  data: {
    LLM: "The trump Jack (20 points) and trump 9 (14 points) are the most powerful cards. Try to win tricks containing these. Count your high cards and plan accordingly.\n\nTrump management is crucial. With many trumps, lead them early to draw out opponents' trumps. Save trumps for winning valuable tricks. Watch which cards have been played.\n\nThe Kontra decision is strategic. Call Kontra when you believe opponents have overbid or when you have strong defensive cards. Signal to your partner through lead choices. In trump selection, choose suits where you have length and strength.",
